refactor(auth): migrate WorkspaceId to ApiContext and enforce strict encapsulation

- Refactored `WorkspaceId` validation by introducing `ApiContext` Enum (`System` vs `Tenant`) to securely distinguish route scopes at the Axum extraction layer.
- Injected `ApiContext` into system handlers (`system_tenants.rs`, `system_admin.rs`) to automatically enforce that tenant-bound extractors cannot be used in system routes.
- Enforced Strict Encapsulation for `WorkspaceId` by making the inner `Uuid` field private.
- Introduced `WorkspaceId::into_inner()` and standard `From<Uuid>` traits for idiomatic newtype unwrapping.
- Added new Strict Encapsulation (OOP Style) rule to the `coding-standards.md` to prevent future data leakage via public fields.
- Achieved 100% compilation safety and added relevant unit tests for context extraction.
